        "schema:description": "Flash pyrolysis coupled to gas chromatography and tandem mass spectrometry, with simultaneous full scan and timed SRM/MRM acquisition targeting 38 organic compounds; instrument method Mojarro_88min_MRM_4_IOM+FullScan_10_1_Split_py. Each step follows one part of the protocol, and two record their own sub-steps.",
        "schema:step": [
