                "@type": "schema:HowTo"
              }
            },
            "schema:name": "Load the sample into a quartz tube",
            "schema:description": "About 1 mg of bulk aggregate from the TAGSAM collection device was loaded and weighed inside a quartz tube, and the tube was placed into the pyrolysis oven interfaced with the GC-MS.",
